a**\r\n\r\nIt generates an error when executing this command that is in the file Dockerfile.grafana.\r\n\r\n**My temporary solution was:**\r\n\r\n I commented the following lines:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24255842/49253250-2bf75780-f3f4-11e8-98e6-6a490d6a8e79.png)\r\n\r\nAfter I execute the following command: **docker-compose up -d influxdb**\r\n\r\nAnd then through postman the following:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/24255842/49253364-7d9fe200-f3f4-11e8-9587-cdc0ef6def23.png)\r\n\r\nAnd finally i run again: **docker-compose up -d influxdb grafana**\r\n\r\nAnd it worked!\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grafana/k6/issues/comments/443002357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Julianhm9612","id":24255842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjU1ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24255842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612","html_url":"https://github.com/Julianhm9612","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Julianhm9612/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grafana/k6/issues/comments/443126073","html_url":"https: